# Used by `zcli push` to package source for deployment — when this file exists, zcli uses
# it INSTEAD of .gitignore. We intentionally do NOT exclude app/build/web here: the `web`
# service deploys those prebuilt Flutter statics, which are gitignored and would otherwise
# be dropped from the upload (the cause of "target 'app/build/web/~' is missing").
.git/
.dart_tool/
slides/
*.zip
